{"availability":"available","full":"AI4Finance-Foundation/FinGPT","name":"FinGPT","description":"FinGPT: Open-Source Financial Large Language Models!  Revolutionize 🔥    We release the trained model on HuggingFace.","category":"Finance","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":21349,"forks":3025,"created":"2023-02-11T20:21:34Z","updated":"2026-09-23T01:59:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://fingpt.io","topics":["chatgpt","finance","fingpt","fintech","large-language-models","machine-learning","nlp","prompt-engineering","pytorch","reinforcement-learning","robo-advisor","sentiment-analysis","technical-analysis"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/FinGPT/FinGPT-Forecaster","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T19:20:59.331Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T19:20:59.331Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T19:20:59.331Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:23.318Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:53.777Z","stars":21329,"forks":3024},{"at":"2026-10-04T19:20:59.331Z","stars":21349,"forks":3025}],"technologies":[],"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:34:03.102Z","latestRelease":{"name":"FinGPT v1.0.0 – Open-Source Financial AI Platform","tag":"v1.0.0","publishedAt":"2026-04-08T15:21:23Z","url":"https://github.com/AI4Finance-Foundation/FinGPT/releases/tag/v1.0.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:34:03.102Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/8bb121843f32cbe4e86a62e7.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-03T10:51:12.119Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/FinGPT/FinGPT-Forecaster"}],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Let us not expect Wall Street to open-source LLMs or open APIs, due to FinTech institutes' internal regulations and policies.","1). Finance is highly dynamic. BloombergGPT trained an LLM using a mixture of finance data and general-purpose data, which took about 53 days, at a cost of around $3M). It is costly to retrain an LLM model like BloombergGPT every month or every week, thus lightweight adaptation is highly favorable. FinGPT can be fine-tuned swiftly to incorporate new data (the cost falls significantly, less than $300 per fine-tuning).","2). Democratizing Internet-scale financial data is critical, say allowing timely updates of the model (monthly or weekly updates) using an automatic data curation pipeline. BloombergGPT has privileged data access and APIs, while FinGPT presents a more accessible alternative. It prioritizes lightweight adaptation, leveraging the best available open-source LLMs."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AI4Finance-Foundation/FinGPT/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8f2b9963d39c4a6e9ef558db018cfa1abf66126906912a55a8dc261647140aaf","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:00:16.942Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:23.316Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-23T01:59:08Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/FinGPT/FinGPT-Forecaster","attemptedAt":"2026-10-03T10:51:12.093Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:51:12.093Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-03T10:51:12.093Z","target":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/FinGPT/FinGPT-Forecaster","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-10T10:51:12.093Z"},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Let us not expect Wall Street to open-source LLMs or open APIs, due to FinTech institutes' internal regulations and policies.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AI4Finance-Foundation/FinGPT/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8f2b9963d39c4a6e9ef558db018cfa1abf66126906912a55a8dc261647140aaf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AI4Finance-Foundation/FinGPT/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:23.317Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:51:09.139Z","agentContextAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T22:15:00.708Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AI4Finance-Foundation/FinGPT/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:15:02.110Z","hash":"8f2b9963d39c4a6e9ef558db018cfa1abf66126906912a55a